namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamText:bAutoWrapText {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:bAutoWrapText
    src   "Wrap the text even when the overflow policy is not VerticalOverflow -- UMG's AutoWrapText, which\nit keeps separate from its overflow policy for exactly this reason. With Ellipsis it is what\nturns a single elided line into a wrapped paragraph whose LAST visible line is elided; with\nTruncate, a paragraph cut off at the bottom of the box. VerticalOverflow always wraps, so this\nchanges nothing there."
    text  "即使溢出策略不是 VerticalOverflow，也对文本换行——即 UMG 的 AutoWrapText，\nUMG 正是出于这个原因才把它与溢出策略分开。配合 Ellipsis 时，它会把单行省略\n变成整段换行，并且只对最后一行可见文本做省略；配合 Truncate 时，\n则是在框的底部截断段落。VerticalOverflow 总是换行，\n所以此项对它没有影响。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:bBestFit {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:bBestFit
    src   "Shrink the font until the text fits the content box, uGUI's Best Fit. FontSize becomes the\nsize the text is allowed to reach rather than the size it is drawn at, and BestFitMinSize is\nhow small it may go before the text is simply allowed to overflow.\n\nNeither UMG nor Slate has an equivalent: their text is content-sized, so the box grows to the\ntext instead. Here the box is authored, which is exactly the case that needs this."
    text  "缩小字体，直到文本能放进内容框，即 uGUI 的 Best Fit。FontSize 变成文本允许达到的\n大小，而不是绘制时所用的大小；BestFitMinSize 则是文本在被直接允许溢出之前可以\n缩小到的下限。\n\nUMG 和 Slate 都没有对应功能：它们的文本按内容调整大小，因此是框随文本变大。\n这里框是由用户指定的，而这正是需要此功能的场景。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:bLigatures {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:bLigatures
    src   "Let the font join letters into its standard and contextual ligatures (\"fi\", \"ffl\"), as browsers do by default\n(Slate's default shaping of left-to-right text has none). The layout leaves them out on its own while FontSpace.X\nis not zero, which is the CSS rule, and so does a text whose characters something animates one by one (see\nRegisterPerCharacterAnimation): a ligature draws several characters as one glyph. Off, it also turns off the\nfont's contextual alternates in Latin, Greek and Cyrillic; scripts that need theirs to join keep them."
    text  "让字体把字母组合为标准连字和上下文连字（“fi”、“ffl”），如同浏览器默认所为\n（Slate 对从左到右文本的默认塑形没有连字）。当 FontSpace.X 不为零时，布局会自行\n不使用连字，这是 CSS 的规则；字符被逐个动画的文本也是如此（见\nRegisterPerCharacterAnimation）：一个连字会把多个字符绘制成一个字形。关闭时，它还会关闭\n字体在拉丁文、希腊文和西里尔文中的上下文替代字形；需要靠这些替代字形连写的书写系统会保留它们。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:bRichText {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:bRichText
    src   "rich text support, eg:\n<b>Bold</b>\n<i>Italic</i>\n<u>Underline</u>\n<s>Strikethrough</s>\n<size=48>Point size 48</size>\n<size=+18>Point size increased by 18</size>\n<size=-18>Point size decreased by 18</size>\n<color=yellow>Yellow text</color> names: black white gray/grey silver red green/lime blue orange\n    purple yellow cyan/aqua magenta/fuchsia maroon navy olive teal pink brown gold transparent\n<color=#0f0>, <color=#0f08>, <color=#00ff00>, <color=#00ff0080> hex, short or long, with or without alpha\n<color=rgb(0,255,0)>, <color=rgba(0,255,0,0.5)> the CSS functional forms; the alpha is 0..1 when\n    it is written with a decimal point, 0..255 otherwise\n<sup>Superscript</sup>\n<sub>Subscript</sub>\n<MyTag>Custom tag</MyTag> use any string as custom tag. custom tag can use for char selection (check TextAnimation usage), and for custom style (check RichTextCustomStyleData)\n<a=Buy>Clickable</a> a custom tag that can also be clicked: put a UUITextHyperlink on the widget\n    and it broadcasts UDreamText::OnHyperlinkClicked with the id\n<img=smile/> display a image with key \"smile\" which defined in RichTextImageData property, can be used for emoji\n<img=smile,24/> the same image 24 tall, as wide as its aspect ratio makes it; <img=smile,24,24/> sets both\n<img=smile,24,baseline/> where the image sits on its line: middle (the default, centred), baseline, top or bottom; an image taller than its line grows the line\n&lt; &gt; &amp; &quot; &apos; &nbsp; and &#1234; / &#x1F600; write a character the markup would\n    otherwise eat -- the only way to show a literal '<'. Plain text does NOT unescape, as in UMG."
    text  "支持富文本，例如：\n<b>粗体</b>\n<i>斜体</i>\n<u>下划线</u>\n<s>删除线</s>\n<size=48>字号 48</size>\n<size=+18>字号增加 18</size>\n<size=-18>字号减少 18</size>\n<color=yellow>黄色文本</color> 颜色名：black white gray/grey silver red green/lime blue orange\n    purple yellow cyan/aqua magenta/fuchsia maroon navy olive teal pink brown gold transparent\n<color=#0f0>#0f0</color>、<color=#0f08>#0f08</color>、<color=#00ff00>#00ff00</color>、<color=#00ff0080>#00ff0080</color> 十六进制，短写或长写，带或不带 alpha\n<color=rgb(0,255,0)>rgb(0,255,0)</color>、<color=rgba(0,255,0,0.5)>rgba(0,255,0,0.5)</color> 是 CSS 函数式写法；alpha 以小数点书写时\n    为 0..1，否则为 0..255\n<sup>上标</sup>\n<sub>下标</sub>\n<MyTag>自定义标签</MyTag> 可用任意字符串作为自定义标签。自定义标签可用于字符选择（参见 TextAnimation 用法）以及自定义样式（参见 RichTextCustomStyleData）\n<a=Buy>可点击</a> 一种还可点击的自定义标签：在控件上放置 UUITextHyperlink，\n    它就会带着 id 广播 UDreamText::OnHyperlinkClicked\n<img=smile/> 显示键为“smile”的图像，该键在 RichTextImageData 属性中定义，可用于 emoji\n<img=smile,24/> 同一图像高 24，宽度按其宽高比确定；<img=smile,24,24/> 则同时设置两者\n<img=smile,24,baseline/> 图像在其行上的位置：middle（默认，居中）、baseline、top 或 bottom；比所在行更高的图像会把该行撑高\n&lt; &gt; &amp; &quot; &apos; &nbsp; 以及 &#1234; / &#x1F600; 用于写出标记本会\n    吞掉的字符——这是显示字面 '<' 的唯一方法。与 UMG 一样，纯文本不会进行反转义。"
    state machine
}

