DreamText:ExpandMeshSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:ExpandMeshSize
    src   "Expand character's rect area to generate bigger mesh, useful for effects of OverrideMaterial.\nOnly valid for SDF font. In pixels at the font's SampleFontSize, and at most the font's SDFRadius\nless 0.02 em: that is all the field a glyph's atlas cell holds, so a larger value draws the same."
    text  "扩大字符的矩形区域以生成更大的网格，对 OverrideMaterial（重载材质）的效果很有用。\n仅对 SDF 字体有效。以像素为单位，基于字体的 SampleFontSize，且最多为字体的 SDFRadius\n减去 0.02 em：这就是字形图集单元所能容纳的全部空间，因此更大的值绘制效果相同。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:FacePaintPhase {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:FacePaintPhase
    src   "Where the face paint's gradient stands along its line, in fractions of its length (FDreamPaintAnimation::Phase): 1\nmoves it one whole gradient on. Animated -- keyed in Sequencer, tweened by UDreamTextPaintLibrary::PaintPhaseTo -- it\nwrites one pixel of the text's paint table: no repaint, no layout. Applies to the text's tag paints too."
    text  "面绘制的渐变沿其所在行所处的位置，以行长度的比例表示（FDreamPaintAnimation::Phase）：1\n将其推进一整段渐变。可动画——在 Sequencer 中打关键帧、由 UDreamTextPaintLibrary::PaintPhaseTo 补间——它\n写入文本绘制表的一个像素：无需重绘，无需重新布局。同样适用于文本的标签绘制。"
    state machine
}

