DreamText:FontSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:FontSize
    src   "The font has the last word: a rasterizing font (bitmap, and the FreeType base) caps the size it\nwill render at GetFontSizeLimit(), 200 by default, and lays out at the cap. A distance-field font\nhas no cap, which is why this metadata's ceiling is the higher of the two."
    text  "字体有最终决定权：光栅化字体（位图字体和 FreeType 基础字体）会将其\n渲染大小限制在 GetFontSizeLimit()（默认 200），并按该上限布局。距离场字体\n没有上限，因此此元数据的上限取两者中较高者。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:GetHyperlinks {
