    src   "The `<a=Id>...</a>` ranges in this text, as character ranges with their ids. A hyperlink is a\ncustom tag that can also be clicked, so these are a filtered view of GetRichTextCustomTagArray."
    text  "此文本中的 `<a=Id>...</a>` 范围，即带有各自 id 的字符范围。超链接是一种\n也可点击的自定义标签，因此这些是 GetRichTextCustomTagArray 的筛选视图。"
    state machine
}

