DreamText:Language {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:Language
    src   "The language the text is written in, as a culture name (\"ja\", \"zh-Hans\", \"en-US\"): the font's fallbacks meant for it\nare preferred (FDreamUIFontFallback::Cultures), and HarfBuzz picks the forms a script draws differently per language\n(locl). Empty, the default, is the game's current language. A rich text's <lang=xx>...</lang> overrides it for what\nthe tag encloses. Line breaking follows the game's culture whatever this says."
    text  "文本所使用的语言，以文化名称表示（“ja”、“zh-Hans”、“en-US”）：会优先使用为该语言准备的字体回退项\n（FDreamUIFontFallback::Cultures），HarfBuzz 也会按语言选择文字的不同绘制形式\n（locl）。留空（默认值）表示游戏当前的语言。富文本的 <lang=xx>...</lang> 会对其包含的内容\n重载此设置。无论此项如何设置，换行都遵循游戏的文化设置。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:LastLineAlign {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:LastLineAlign
    src   "How a justified paragraph's last line, and a line a newline ends, align (HAlign Justify only)."
    text  "两端对齐段落中最后一行以及由换行符结束的行的对齐方式（仅 HAlign Justify 适用）。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:LineHeightPercentage {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:LineHeightPercentage
    src   "Scales the distance from one line to the next, 1 being the font's own line height -- UMG's\nLineHeightPercentage. Only the gap between lines moves; the glyphs keep their size, so this\ntightens or opens up a paragraph without changing how big the letters are.\n\nFontSpace.Y is added on top and is a flat distance, which is the difference between the two:\none scales with the font, the other does not."
    text  "缩放一行到下一行的距离，1 表示字体自身的行高——即 UMG 的\nLineHeightPercentage。只有行与行之间的间隙会移动，字形大小保持不变，因此这\n可以在不改变字母大小的前提下收紧或撑开段落。\n\nFontSpace.Y 会在此基础上额外附加，且是固定距离，这就是两者的区别：\n一个随字体缩放，另一个不随。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:Margin {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:Margin
    src   "Padding between the widget's rect and the text laid out inside it, the way UMG's text Margin\nworks. The text is wrapped, aligned and overflow-tested against the rect MINUS this, so a\nmargin narrows the wrap width rather than just shifting the result.\n\nIt also grows what this text reports as its preferred size, so a parent that sizes itself to\nits content leaves room for the padding instead of squeezing it back out."
    text  "控件矩形与其内部排布的文本之间的填充，工作方式与 UMG 文本的 Margin\n相同。文本的换行、对齐和溢出检测都基于矩形减去该值后的区域进行，因此\n边距会收窄换行宽度，而不只是平移结果。\n\n它还会增大此文本报告的期望尺寸，因此按内容调整自身大小的父级\n会为填充留出空间，而不会将其挤回去。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:MinDesiredWidth {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:MinDesiredWidth
    src   "Floor under the width this text reports to a content-sized parent, UMG's MinDesiredWidth. Keeps a\nlabel that is momentarily short (a number counting down, a name that has not arrived) from\ncollapsing the row around it. Zero means no floor. It is a layout request only: nothing here\nclips or stretches the glyphs, and the text still draws inside whatever box the parent gives it."
    text  "此文本向按内容调整大小的父级所报告宽度的下限，即 UMG 的 MinDesiredWidth。可避免\n短暂变短的标签（倒计时数字、尚未到达的名称）\n使其所在行塌缩。零表示没有下限。它只是布局请求：此处不会裁剪或拉伸字形，\n文本仍绘制在父级给定的框内。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:OnHyperlinkClickedBP {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:OnHyperlinkClickedBP
    src   "Broadcast by TryClickHyperlinkAtWorldPosition; UUITextHyperlink is what routes pointer clicks into it."
    text  "由 TryClickHyperlinkAtWorldPosition 广播；UUITextHyperlink 负责将指针点击路由到它。"
