DreamText:PaintAngleOffset {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:PaintAngleOffset
    src   "Degrees added to every paint's angle (a Linear's direction, a Conic's start, a Diamond's turn). One pixel of the paint table a change, as the phases."
    text  "为每个笔触添加的角度（线性笔触的方向，锥形笔触的起始位置，菱形笔触的转动角度）。笔触表中的每个像素都会发生变化，就像相位一样。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:PhraseWrap {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:PhraseWrap
    src   "Keep CJK words together when wrapping, using ICU's dictionary -- CSS's `word-break: auto-phrase`.\nOnly matters with VerticalOverflow. Needs the packaged ICU data to include the CJK dictionary\n(Project Settings > Packaging > Internationalization Support: CJK, EFIGSCJK or All); without it\nthis quietly falls back to per-character breaks."
    text  "使用 ICU 词典在换行时保持 CJK 词语完整——即 CSS 的 `word-break: auto-phrase`。\n仅在 VerticalOverflow 时有效。需要打包的 ICU 数据包含 CJK 词典\n（项目设置 > 打包 > 国际化支持：CJK、EFIGSCJK 或 All）；否则\n会静默回退为按字符换行。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:RegisterPerCharacterAnimation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:RegisterPerCharacterAnimation
    src   "Something that animates this text's characters one by one -- TextAnimation, which moves each glyph by its index in\nGetCharPropertyArray -- registers here for as long as it does so. A ligature draws several characters as one glyph,\nwhich would leave such an animator glyphs short, so the text lays out without ligatures while anything is\nregistered; and each character's underline and strikethrough are painted as pieces of its own, which the animator\nmoves with it, instead of one strip across a run. Registering the same animator twice counts once, and an animator\nthat is destroyed stops counting."
    text  "逐个动画此文本字符的对象——TextAnimation，它按每个字形在\nGetCharPropertyArray 中的索引移动字形——在动画期间会在此注册。连字会把多个字符绘制成一个字形，\n这会使此类动画器缺字形，因此只要有对象注册，文本布局就不使用连字；\n并且每个字符的下划线和删除线都作为各自的片段绘制，由动画器\n随字符一起移动，而不是整段画一条线。同一动画器注册两次只计一次，已销毁的动画器\n停止计数。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:RichTextCustomStyleData {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:RichTextCustomStyleData
    src   "rich text custom style data for custom tag and rendering custom style"
    text  "用于自定义标签和渲染自定义样式的富文本自定义样式数据。"
    state machine
}

