DreamText:SetFacePaint {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:SetFacePaint
    src   "PAINTS (FDreamTextPaint, the paint fields of FDreamTextStyle). Each setter does what SetTextStyle does with the one\nfield changed, at the least cost: a layer turned on or off, or the boxes, repaint the quads (their slots, UV4 and\ncolours); another gradient or preset for a layer still painting, and the overlay blend, write rows and the table\nonly -- another gradient row taken and the text's table written, with no repaint; nothing here lays the text out\nagain."
    text  "绘制（FDreamTextPaint，即 FDreamTextStyle 的绘制字段）。每个 setter 都做 SetTextStyle 在只改动一个\n字段时所做的事，且代价最小：启用或关闭图层，或修改框，会重绘四边形（其槽位、UV4 和\n颜色）；为仍在绘制的图层换用另一个渐变或预设，以及叠加混合，只写入行和表\n—— 取另一渐变行并写入文本的表，不重绘；这里的任何操作都不会重新布局\n文本。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:SetFacePaintPhase {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:SetFacePaintPhase
    src   "PAINT ANIMATION: what the text moves its paints by, one pixel of its paint table a change -- no repaint, no layout\n(a text whose material does not shade through MF_DreamUI_Shade, painted in its vertex colours, repaints instead)."
    text  "绘制动画：文本移动其绘制所依据的量，绘制表每变化一个像素即为此值——不重绘、不重新布局\n（材质不通过 MF_DreamUI_Shade 着色、以顶点色绘制的文本则会重绘）。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:SetFillProgress {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:SetFillProgress
    src   "Fill progress of every line, 0..1; glyphs inside a fill segment keep the segment's own value."
    text  "每行的填充进度，范围为 0..1；填充段中的字形保留该段自己的值。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:SetFillSegments {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:SetFillSegments
    src   "Character runs that fill independently (a lyric line's words or syllables). Replaces the previous set."
    text  "独立填充的字符行（歌词行的单词或音节）。替换之前的设置。"
    state machine
}

DreamText:SetLanguage {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:SetLanguage
    src   "A culture name, or empty for the game's current language; see Language."
    text  "文化名称，或留空表示游戏当前语言；请参阅“语言”。"
