    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#DreamText:SetPaintBoxes
    src   "What the text's own paints are measured across, across and down (FDreamTextStyle::PaintBoxHorizontal, PaintBoxVertical)."
    text  "文本自身绘制在横向和纵向上的测量依据（FDreamTextStyle::PaintBoxHorizontal、PaintBoxVertical）。"
