EDreamTextSmallTextRaster.Auto {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamText.h#EDreamTextSmallTextRaster:Auto
    src   "Coverage glyphs wherever the project, the font and the text's situation allow (UDreamGUISettings::bSmallTextCoverage)."
    text  "在项目、字体和文本显示条件允许的情况下，使用覆盖字形 (UDreamGUISettings::bSmallTextCoverage)。"
    state machine
